          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "会議で出た現場の意見を、新しい企画案にしっかり織り込む必要がある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "伝統的な要素を現代風のデザインに織り込むのが、今回の試みだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "歴史的背景の解説を、物語の展開の中に自然に織り込む。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
